<%- include('../partials/head') %>

<%- include('../partials/breadcrumbs') %>

<div class="pagehead">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
    <p class="meta-updated"><% if (reviewedOn) { %>Last reviewed <%= reviewedOn %>. <% } %>This policy describes what this website does with personal data.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="wrap prose">
    <h2>Who is responsible for your data</h2>
    <p>
      <% if (dataController) { %><%= dataController %><% } else { %>The licensed firearms dealer that operates this shop<% } %>
      is the data controller for this website.
      <% if (hasRealAddress) { %>
        The registered address is <%= business.address.street %>, <%= business.address.locality %>,
        <%= business.address.region %> <%= business.address.postalCode %>, <%= business.address.country %>.
      <% } %>
      <% if (hasRealPrivacyEmail) { %>
        Privacy questions go to <a href="mailto:<%= business.contact.privacyEmail %>"><%= business.contact.privacyEmail %></a>.
      <% } else { %>
        A dedicated privacy contact address is published here before launch.
      <% } %>
    </p>

    <h2>What this site collects</h2>
    <p>The site collects the smallest amount of data that lets it work. There is no account system, no profile building and no data brokerage.</p>
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr><th scope="col">Where</th><th scope="col">What</th><th scope="col">Why</th><th scope="col">Kept for</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td>Contact form</td>
          <td>Name, email address, optional state and phone number, message text</td>
          <td>To answer the question you asked and to quote a transfer for your location</td>
          <td><%= retentionMonths %> months</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Order request form</td>
          <td>Name, email address, optional phone number, message text, the list of items you selected, your confirmations</td>
          <td>To check availability and eligibility and to quote a transfer</td>
          <td><%= retentionMonths %> months</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Basket cookie</td>
          <td>Item identifiers and quantities</td>
          <td>So your selection survives moving between pages</td>
          <td>14 days</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Security cookie</td>
          <td>A random token</td>
          <td>To stop another website submitting forms on your behalf</td>
          <td>4 hours</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Consent cookie</td>
          <td>Your cookie choice</td>
          <td>So the site stops asking</td>
          <td>6 months</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Web server logs</td>
          <td>IP address, request path, timestamp, status code</td>
          <td>Security, abuse handling and fault diagnosis</td>
          <td>Set by the hosting provider, published here once hosting is confirmed</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <h2>What this site does not collect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>No date of birth, home address or identity document is requested by any form on this site.</li>
      <li>No firearms licence number is requested by any form on this site.</li>
      <li>Card details are processed securely via encrypted payment provider. No card numbers are stored on this server.</li>
      <li>No advertising or cross site tracking pixels are loaded.</li>
      <li>No data is sold or shared with data brokers.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Legal basis</h2>
    <p>
      Form data is processed on the basis of your consent, which you give with the checkbox on the form
      and can withdraw at any time by asking for your record to be deleted. Basket and security cookies are
      strictly necessary for the site to function. Measurement cookies, if the shop ever enables them, are set
      only after you allow them in the cookie banner.
    </p>

    <h2>Who else sees it</h2>
    <p>
      The hosting provider processes data on the shop's behalf in order to run the servers. If the shop
      enables email notifications, the email provider handles the message in transit. Both are listed by
      name here once hosting and email are confirmed. Data is disclosed to a public authority only where
      the law requires it.
    </p>

    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>
      You can ask for a copy of the data held about you, ask for it to be corrected, ask for it to be
      deleted, or withdraw consent. Contact the address above. The exact statutory rights that apply depend
      on where you live and are confirmed here alongside the jurisdiction the shop operates in.
    </p>

    <h2>Retention and deletion</h2>
    <p>
      Every submission record carries a deletion date of <%= retentionMonths %> months from the day it was
      received. A scheduled task deletes expired records automatically rather than relying on someone
      remembering to do it.
    </p>

    <h2>Children</h2>
    <p>
      This site is not intended for use by children. Firearms cannot lawfully be sold to minors, and the
      checkout form requires an age confirmation before it can be submitted.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>
      Material changes to this policy are dated at the top of the page. The previous version is kept in the
      project's version control history.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>

<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
